    {
      "type": "FUNCTION",
      "name": "bullet3d.rigid_body.set_gravity",
      "brief": "Set body gravity",
      "description": "A later <code>bullet3d.world.set_gravity()</code> call, or removing and re-adding the\nbody to a world, can overwrite custom body gravity unless the body's\n<code>BT_DISABLE_WORLD_GRAVITY</code> flag is set.",
      "returnvalues": [],
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "body",
          "doc": "rigid body",
          "types": ["btRigidBody"],
          "is_optional": "False"
        },
        {
          "name": "gravity",
          "doc": "gravity in Defold units per second squared",
          "types": ["vector3"],
          "is_optional": "False"
        }
      ],
      "examples": "Give one body persistent custom gravity without discarding its other flags:\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kr\">function</span> <span class=\"nf\">init</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">self</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kd\">local</span> <span class=\"n\">body</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_rigid_body</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;#collisionobject&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kd\">local</span> <span class=\"n\">flags</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rigid_body</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_flags</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">flags</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">bit</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bor</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">flags</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rigid_body</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">BT_DISABLE_WORLD_GRAVITY</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rigid_body</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set_flags</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">flags</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rigid_body</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set_gravity</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">vmath</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">vector3</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"kr\">end</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
      "replaces": "",
      "error": "",
      "tparams": [],
      "members": [],
      "notes": [],
      "language": ""
